# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/

# IDE / editor folders
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Git
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Docker files themselves (no need to copy into the image)
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore

# Test results / coverage
**/TestResults/
**/*.trx
**/coverage/

# NuGet
**/*.nupkg
**/packages/
**/.nuget/

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs/

# OS junk
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Docs/misc (optional — skip if you don't want these excluded)
README.md
*.md
LICENSE

# Environment / secrets — never bake these into an image
.env
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/secrets.json